Invoking Lemma~ef{lem:estimator} with $\widehat{ m ho} = { m ho}^{(L)}$ reveals the following bound concerning the estimate ${ m ho}^{(L)}$:  egin{align} \mathbb{E} ig[ ig({ m \phi}_{N+1}^{	op}{{ m ho}}^{(L)} - f({ m x}_{N+1}) ig)^2 ig] &\overset{	ext{(a)}}{\lesssim} \sqrt{ rac{\log N}{N}} ig(C_{\mathcal{F}}^2 + \lambda^{-2}\varepsilon_{\mathsf{opt}}^2 + \sigma C_\mathcal{F} ig) + \varepsilon_{\mathsf{dis}}^2 + \lambda C_{\mathcal{F}} + \varepsilon_{\mathsf{opt}}
